    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/fa313887df3c25651dec4e29ee487476.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>Do you want to connect? Are you interested in the game? Do you want updates on the development? Join the Official Discord Server by clicking on the link in the sidebar and become a part of our growing community!</p><br><h1>Play The Demo!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/84ce9670c29ca87f021fd7e2fd8d9373.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br><strong>Interested in what the experience may entail?</strong><br>Try out the Demo! It will be periodically updated to reflect the latest polish adjustments to give you the best idea of what the finished game will be like.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/38d0c00a07f2f80521732ca24ef9c1bd.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>The Source is a unique modern take on the classic Text Adventure genre. An outsider to a foreign world, you must choose a kingdom to help gain an ancient power locked deep beneath a mysterious Well. Explore each kingdom, solve puzzles, and uncover the mystery surrounding this shattered world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/82b3e245b4c741d7a296de73e6890a56.poster.avif?t=1729564274\" width=608 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/82b3e245b4c741d7a296de73e6890a56.webm?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/82b3e245b4c741d7a296de73e6890a56.mp4?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/45be520b281bd81d431476b88993f631.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>Explore a vast and interconnected world filled with secrets...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/d06abaa30157d4407a613dd12f8117e3.poster.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/d06abaa30157d4407a613dd12f8117e3.webm?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/d06abaa30157d4407a613dd12f8117e3.mp4?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/5f4aebcab1ee884f7c8b93bbad13c9a5.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>Your choices will radically affect the story and gameplay. Choose wisely, our fate is in your hands...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/6b3224bc700562343e82e6e7e7a17067.poster.avif?t=1729564274\" width=694 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/6b3224bc700562343e82e6e7e7a17067.webm?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/6b3224bc700562343e82e6e7e7a17067.mp4?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/9608a8799b05bb965e27c2f02afe2c21.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>I believe in making games that as many people as possible to enjoy, and for this reason the game will include a large amount of accessibility options so you are as comfortable playing the game as possible.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Contrast adjustments (gamma)<br></li><li> Reduce or remove background particles<br></li><li> Change the game font to make it easier to read<br></li><li> Change the colour of the text to make it easier to read<br></li><li> Reduce or turn off text animations<br></li><li> Turn off screen shake effects</li></ul><strong>All Of This and More to Come!!!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/84ce9670c29ca87f021fd7e2fd8d9373.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>You can play the Demo RIGHT NOW!!! As the game continues to be developed, the Demo will be updated periodically to reflect the best experience possible!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/fa313887df3c25651dec4e29ee487476.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>Are you interested in the game? Do you want updates on the development? Join the Official Discord Server and become a part of our growing community! The link is in the sidebar!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/38d0c00a07f2f80521732ca24ef9c1bd.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>The Source is a unique modern take on the classic Text Adventure genre. An outsider to a foreign world, you must choose a kingdom to help gain an ancient power locked deep beneath a mysterious Well. Explore each kingdom, solve puzzles, and uncover the mystery surrounding this shattered world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/82b3e245b4c741d7a296de73e6890a56.poster.avif?t=1729564274\" width=608 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/82b3e245b4c741d7a296de73e6890a56.webm?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/82b3e245b4c741d7a296de73e6890a56.mp4?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/45be520b281bd81d431476b88993f631.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>Explore a vast and interconnected world filled with secrets...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/d06abaa30157d4407a613dd12f8117e3.poster.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/d06abaa30157d4407a613dd12f8117e3.webm?t=1729564274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/d0