74340/extras/84ce9670c29ca87f021fd7e2fd8d9373.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>You can play the Demo RIGHT NOW!!! As the game continues to be developed, the Demo will be updated periodically to reflect the best experience possible!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574340/extras/fa313887df3c25651dec4e29ee487476.avif?t=1729564274\" width=500 height=273 /></span><br>Are you interested in the game? Do you want updates on the development? Join the Official Discord Server and become a part of our growing community! The link is in the sidebar!",
